          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_4HjQGT": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How does Datmos help me understand my store’s performance?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_NxWgWD": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We distill complexity into clarity by providing a strategic perspective on your data.Instead of overloading you with raw numbers, we focus on data-driven growth and measurable outcomes that align with your specific business goals.We’re here to help you identify the \"why\" behind your metrics so you can move forward with confidence.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "paragraph_size": "paragraph-md",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "custom_color": "#000000",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0,
                    "hidden_mobile": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_NxWgWD"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_EMgJ3U": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What makes your approach to commerce strategy different?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_w6iHRj": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We believe that a truly progressive commerce strategy must blend strategic insight with world-class digital experience design.Rather than offering a generic, \"one-stop shop\" solution, we work as an extension of your team to create a purposeful, structured path to growth.Our deep expertise allows us to turn abstract ideas into actionable steps that drive faster growth.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "paragraph_size": "paragraph-md",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "custom_color": "#000000",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0,
                    "hidden_mobile": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_w6iHRj"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_gx4QEq": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can Datmos help us improve our customer experience?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_KixVXn": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Absolutely.We recognize the people behind the businesses we serve, which is why our design philosophy is inherently human and empathetic.We help you activate your data to create seamless, intuitive experiences that address your audience’s needs without overstepping professional boundaries.Our focus is on creating a digital experience that feels as authentic as it is effective.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "paragraph_size": "paragraph-md",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
